{"html":"<p>Uploading a 12 MB photo to a server to resize it is a waste of everyone's\nbandwidth. This project moves the pixels to the client: Rust compiled to\nWebAssembly, driven by a tiny JS UI, processing a 4000×3000 image in under 200 ms.</p>\n<p><strong>What it is:</strong> a wasm module exposing <code>resize(bytes, w, h) -> bytes</code>, a\n<code>blur(radius)</code> and <code>watermark(text)</code>, plus a drag-and-drop page that shows before\nand after.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-you-learn\">What you learn</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Skill</th>\n<th>Where it comes from</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>The wasm boundary</td>\n<td><code>wasm-bindgen</code>, <code>Uint8Array</code>, avoiding copies</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Binary size discipline</td>\n<td><code>opt-level=\"s\"</code>, <code>lto</code>, <code>wasm-opt -Oz</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Memory in the browser</td>\n<td>linear memory, <code>Vec</code> → JS transfer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Async in wasm</td>\n<td><code>web-sys</code>, canvas, <code>createImageBitmap</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shipping</td>\n<td><code>trunk</code>, cache headers, brotli</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"milestones\">Milestones</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>#</th>\n<th>Ship</th>\n<th>Done when</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td><code>add(a,b)</code> in wasm</td>\n<td>the page calls Rust</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Decode + encode an image</td>\n<td>round-trip a PNG byte-for-byte</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Resize</td>\n<td>4000×3000 → 800×600 in &#x3C; 200 ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Convolve</td>\n<td>a box blur that does not freeze the tab</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Drag and drop</td>\n<td>files in, preview out</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>Under 300 KB</td>\n<td>wasm + JS, brotli-compressed</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"crates\">Crates</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">lib</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">crate-type = [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"cdylib\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"rlib\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]     </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\"># cdylib for wasm, rlib so `cargo test` works</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">dependencies</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">wasm-bindgen = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"0.2\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">js-sys = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"0.3\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">web-sys = { version = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"0.3\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, features = [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"console\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"Window\"