style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">*</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> w </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">*</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">..</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(y </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">+</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">*</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> w </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">*</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">];</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">        let</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> mut</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> acc </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">u32</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">4</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">];</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">        // sliding window over the row, clamped at the edges</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">        // (see the repo for the full loop)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">        let</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> _ </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">&#x26;mut</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> acc, row, radius);</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">    // vertical pass is the same with a stride of w*4</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"js\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"js\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">// keep the UI responsive: run per-tile in a worker, or yield between rows</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">const</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> worker</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> new</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\"> Worker</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"/blur-worker.js\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">);</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">worker.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">postMessage</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">({ buf, w, h, radius }, [buf.buffer]);   </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">// transfer, no copy</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Transferring the <code>ArrayBuffer</code> (second argument to <code>postMessage</code>) moves ownership\ninstead of copying — the single biggest win for large images.</p>\n<h2 id=\"size-budget\">Size budget</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Step</th>\n<th>Bytes</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>naive build</td>\n<td>~1.4 MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>opt-level=\"s\"</code> + <code>lto</code></td>\n<td>~900 KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>panic=\"abort\"</code></td>\n<td>~760 KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wasm-opt -Oz</code></td>\n<td>~620 KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>brotli over the wire</td>\n<td>~210 KB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Drop <code>image</code>'s default features — it pulls in every format decoder. <code>default-features = false, features = [\"png\", \"jpeg\"]</code> alone is worth ~300 KB.</p>\n<h2 id=\"stretch-goals\">Stretch goals</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A <code>--simd128</code> build with a hand-written SIMD blur.</li>\n<li>OffscreenCanvas rendering.</li>\n<li>Batch mode: process 50 images, show a progress bar from wasm callbacks.</li>\n<li>A worker pool sized to <code>navigator.hardwareConcurrency</code>.</li>\n<li>Compare against a pure-JS implementation and publish the numbers.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"demo-checklist\">Demo checklist</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> a 12 MB JPEG resized in the browser with the network tab showing zero uploads</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> the wasm bundle under 300 KB compressed</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> the tab stays interactive during a blur</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> <code>cargo test</code> still runs natively against the same code</li>\n</ul>"}